e; a crafted workbench was placed, opened through the station runtime, then dismantled and recovered through real actions.\"\n    },\n    \"C4\": {\n      \"status\": \"PASS\",\n      \"observation\": \"Real traversal shifted four Chunk centers while client resources stayed bounded, and returning produced a new trace ID for the same Chunk key through Worker completion, mesh commit and postrender visibility.\"\n    },\n    \"C5\": {\n      \"status\": \"PASS\",\n      \"observation\": \"Save and return created a fresh epoch, restored build/workbench/inventory state, reacquired and reopened the station through visible target-card readback plus real mouse input, and accepted a new real movement input.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"faultDesign\": {\n    \"wrongPlaybook\": \"C0 rejects a loaded identity or Pack asset other than Classic.\",\n    \"inputBypass\": \"C1 requires Pointer Lock plus acknowledged keyboard input and an authority trajectory crossing a Chunk boundary.\",\n    \"mutationWithoutPresentation\": \"C2/C3 require both the authoritative voxel result and a consumed mesh commit on WebGL2.\",\n    \"counterWithoutCausality\": \"Worker and Wasm counters are baselined after fixture setup and must advance with the route's own streaming work; a four-center stream shift must also keep client Chunk resources bounded before the return rebuild.\",\n    \"retiredActorLeak\": \"C0 requires the retired Classic settler to remain unavailable and the canonical fixture to run without custom NPCs.\",\n    \"reloadWithoutFreshness\": \"C5 requires a new runtime epoch, restored world/inventory state, and another acknowledged real input.\"\n  },\n  \"coverage\": {\n    \"included\": [\n      \"production preview\",\n      \"Classic Pack admission\",\n      \"Pointer Lock movement turn jump and Chunk crossing\",\n      \"mining drop pickup inventory and personal crafting\",\n      \"placement food existing combat and workbench runtime\",\n      \"creative bucket source round-trip two-Chunk wooden door and jukebox record lifecycle\",\n      \"survival acquisition crafting and pointer interaction for four iron armor slots\",\n      \"streaming resource release and rebuild\",\n      \"save return continue and post-restore interaction\",\n      \"Worker Wasm WebGL2 mesh and telemetry correlation\"\n    ],\n    \"integratedLegacyBrowserProtection\": [\n      {\n        \"source\": \"tests/e2e/regression/world-play.spec.ts\",\n        \"stages\": [\n          \"C1\",\n          \"C2\",\n          \"C3\",\n          \"C5\"\n        ],\n        \"observation\": \"Real Pointer Lock movement, jump, collision-free settling, authoritative edit presentation, Chunk crossing and save/continue are exercised in one world.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"source\": \"changes/2026-09-07-loading-performance/e2e/loading-performance.spec.ts and changes/2026-09-08-node-monorepo/e2e/web-package-runtime.spec.ts\",\n        \"stages\": [\n          \"C0\",\n          \"C4\"\n        ],\n        \"observation\": \"The stamped production artifact must load its admitted Classic Pack, Worker and Wasm bytes; later route work must be completed and consumed.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"source\": \"changes/2026-09-08-gameplay-foundation/e2e and changes/2026-09-10-inventory-pointer-interactions/e2e/inventory-pointer.spec.ts\",\n        \"stages\": [\n          \"C2\",\n          \"C3\",\n          \"C5\"\n        ],\n        \"observation\": \"Real mouse mining, drop pickup, E inventory, 2x2 pointer crafting, shared 3x3 recipe visibility, hotbar keyboard movement, food, placement, and a buffered wood-sword second combo hit are exercised before restored inventory.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"source\": \"changes/2026-09-10-creative-containers-visual-cohesion/e2e/creative-container-interaction.spec.ts\",\n        \"stages\": [\n          \"C3\",\n          \"C5\"\n        ],\n        \"observation\": \"A crafted workbench is placed and opened, then dismantled and picked back int